{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"91e56d777e23b23f1b2990660a272f63a23c74f6c6625952090dd7d8e0eacff5","ja":"そして日常へ","zh":"然后，回归日常","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1e52504f0162bc94db5278d821a142d0c501873fceca78e4e904da6f12c91de0","ja":"「もっとお泊りください」って言われたけど、\n結局そのまま帰ってきちゃったね♪","zh":"虽然对方对我们说“请再多住几天”，\n但结果还是就那么回来了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"73529b5642634bf7385dee15b692a7e2298545266b13365d7a4559f588854870","ja":"はい。おーなーのご厚意はありがたかったのですが、\nらーめんの魅力には抗えず……。","zh":"是的。虽然很感谢店长的好意，\n但还是没能抵挡住拉面的魅力……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d7f3a138c3d1008ebf2050bac05f3e5821b8e009ecf8710b55ef7de488a93520","ja":"さっそく出前の注文をしようと思います。\n皆もいかがでしょう？","zh":"我打算马上叫外卖。\n大家要不要也来点？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7b585ca39261c697a1d623b672c6cc8d5541c5a4ca3b524057fe00888eff6e25","ja":"うふふ、じゃあお願いしちゃおうかしら？\n食べた後は……レッスン頑張らなきゃ。","zh":"呵呵，那我可就不客气咯？\n吃完之后……可得好好加油练习了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"28e6304caa7b174c629e7181728c80769afefcc404153f8ed44cf1ad137a10d9","ja":"私もお願い……ってあれ？　千鶴ちゃんは？","zh":"我也拜托了……咦？千鹤呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d7705c2c3ca00e9ca162be559d0dd28f396737ad9f54e410c4a81fb9c13a19b2","ja":"ただいま戻りましたわ！　お母さ……我が家のシェフが\n作ってくれたコロッケをお持ちしましたわよ♪","zh":"我回来了！我带了妈妈……我们家的厨师\n亲手做的可乐饼哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5fb66f17befd68efabc51cc76f02a601039a8b7fa6015d9fdc10d8b99b710a6f","ja":"……あら？　貴音、ラーメンの出前をとりますの？\nええと、では……。","zh":"……哎呀？贵音，你要点拉面的外卖吗？\n那个，那么……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5916b86202260a996d317054b56ae0b9349ace5b172c04766e9a052408dedf00","ja":"問題ありません。もちろん、\nらーめんと一緒にころっけもいただきます。","zh":"没问题。当然，\n拉面和可乐饼我都会吃的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"123c1d66981cbca9ce47dce8dd2b38d0edbe4068dff172dd4dd4cae94ca95348","ja":"うん！　コロッケラーメンにしちゃうね♪\nありがとう、千鶴ちゃん！","zh":"嗯！那就选可乐饼拉面啦♪\n谢谢你，千鹤！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c9d500b5319f11a3ea6c137d02a640c9712e53ada16fc1823813c88aba4c752b","ja":"まあ……♪　ではお皿に盛りますわね！\nふふっ……。","zh":"哎呀……♪　那我这就装盘吧！\n呵呵……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a87e5359b746d12eed85632ab61c3a0c5e2c2e503902f5178896613543e9a8d6","ja":"高級ホテルも素晴らしかったですが、\nやはり劇場は落ち着きますわね♪","zh":"高级酒店虽然也很棒，\n但果然还是剧场最让人安心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"37df3e27c157eccff4cb418bccccd4c0d5f534f6d070b790f903f3dd64f51441","ja":"そうだね。居心地がよくて、\nすごくほっとできるなって、実感しちゃった。","zh":"是啊。让人深切地体会到，\n这里不仅呆着舒服，还特别让人安心。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1277.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"61909520fe60267f2311b7a2fe0f89088a5733140649329a61e1ff241a993ee1","ja":"本当に……非日常な空間は、何日かで\nお腹いっぱいになっちゃったみたいね、うふふっ♪","zh":"真的……非日常的空间，待上几天好像就\n完全满足了呢，呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
